flowchart TD
    trigger([Integrate, migrate, or debug Native Update]) --> registry[Read living Native Update package rule]
    registry --> shell{Native shell meets v4 floors?}
    shell -->|No| migrate[Upgrade Capacitor, Node, Java, Android/iOS floors and rebuild native shell]
    migrate --> config
    shell -->|Yes| config{nu_app key and RSA public key present?}
    config -->|No| off[Keep OTA fully off without crashing; native reinstall required after keys are added]
    config -->|Yes| init[Initialize once with /api base, signatures required, deltas enabled]
    init --> ready[Immediately call notifyAppReady on every healthy boot]
    ready --> check[Start non-blocking native check after first paint]
    check --> available{Update available?}
    available -->|No| done([No update])
    available -->|Yes| mandatory{Mandatory?}
    mandatory -->|No| prompt{User accepts?}
    prompt -->|No| done
    mandatory -->|Yes| download
    prompt -->|Yes| download[downloadUpdate keeps signed manifest and delta metadata]
    download --> verify{Delta verifies completely?}
    verify -->|Yes| apply[applyUpdate and reload]
    verify -->|No| fallback[Verified signed-full fallback]
    fallback --> apply
    apply --> nextboot[Next boot initializes and calls notifyAppReady]
    nextboot --> marker{Physical-device marker changed?}
    marker -->|Yes| shipped([OTA chain verified])
    marker -->|No| issue[Diagnose and file package issue with full repro]

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef stop fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class shell,config,available,mandatory,prompt,verify,marker gate
    class off,issue stop
    class trigger,done,shipped terminal
